p.src:
The first answer is strict equality. If we are uncertain about our future place in society, equal shares seem like the safest rule: $\begin{aligned}
\text{strict equality} &= \text{equal distribution of income and wealth},\\
\text{strict equality} &\not\Longrightarrow \text{best outcome for the least well-off}.\end{aligned}$

